    "body": "I think the best way to do that is:\r\n\r\n- Extract all of what is currently setHTMLUnsafe() into something like \"unsafe set HTML steps\" given _contextNode_, _target_, and _string_.\r\n- Change Element's setHTMLUnsafe() to call \"unsafe set HTML steps\" given this, this and _string_\r\n- Define ShadowRoot's setHTMLUnsafe() to call \"unsafe set HTML steps\" given this's shadow host, this, and _string_. ",
